sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant API as Friday API
  participant M as AI model
  participant SB as E2B sandbox
  participant GH as GitHub

  U->>API: "Fix the login bug in github.com/acme/app"
  API->>SB: Open sandbox (restore snapshot if expired)
  API->>SB: git clone (token as one-off header, redacted)
  API->>API: Read AGENTS.md / FRIDAY.md / CLAUDE.md
  API->>M: Plan: architecture + todo checklist
  loop up to 45 iterations / 18 min
    M-->>API: friday-ls / grep / read / edit / write / run / start
    API->>SB: Execute action
    SB-->>API: Output, errors, server logs
    API-->>U: Live steps + checklist progress
  end
  API->>SB: Probe app + browser screenshot
  API->>M: Vision review of the page
  U->>API: "Open a PR"
  M-->>API: friday-pr title branch body
  API->>SB: Fresh clone of base, overlay changes, commit, push
  API->>GH: Create pull request
  API-->>U: View pull request link
